# Nx project-graph exclusions. .opencode holds the opencode AI tool's plugin
# manifest (package.json with no `name`) — harmless to git/pnpm but breaks Nx's
# project inference when it lands in a fresh CI checkout (Vercel uploads files
# the nested .opencode/.gitignore doesn't cover). See 2026-08-14 Vercel deploy.
.opencode
.opencode/**
